[
  {
    "id": "c1",
    "startMs": 3140,
    "endMs": 23080,
    "text": "1. The sound of the word photo starts with"
  },
  {
    "id": "c2",
    "startMs": 25000,
    "endMs": 26620,
    "text": "2."
  },
  {
    "id": "c3",
    "startMs": 27440,
    "endMs": 30450,
    "text": "The vowel sound in the word class is R."
  },
  {
    "id": "c4",
    "startMs": 31860,
    "endMs": 33860,
    "text": "3."
  },
  {
    "id": "c5",
    "startMs": 34700,
    "endMs": 37340,
    "text": "My favourite weekend activity is gardening."
  },
  {
    "id": "c6",
    "startMs": 38380,
    "endMs": 40540,
    "text": "4."
  },
  {
    "id": "c7",
    "startMs": 41220,
    "endMs": 43660,
    "text": "She has a strong interest in taking photos."
  },
  {
    "id": "c8",
    "startMs": 45020,
    "endMs": 47080,
    "text": "5."
  },
  {
    "id": "c9",
    "startMs": 47980,
    "endMs": 50560,
    "text": "We often have traditional food during festivals."
  },
  {
    "id": "c10",
    "startMs": 53060,
    "endMs": 54000,
    "text": "6."
  },
  {
    "id": "c11",
    "startMs": 54820,
    "endMs": 58320,
    "text": "Many kids enjoy playing Chinese yo-yo in the park."
  },
  {
    "id": "c12",
    "startMs": 59500,
    "endMs": 61580,
    "text": "7."
  },
  {
    "id": "c13",
    "startMs": 62440,
    "endMs": 65640,
    "text": "She uses a ruler to draw a straight line on her notebook."
  },
  {
    "id": "c14",
    "startMs": 66440,
    "endMs": 68900,
    "text": "8."
  },
  {
    "id": "c15",
    "startMs": 69640,
    "endMs": 72040,
    "text": "The little boy stands like a small pine tree."
  },
  {
    "id": "c16",
    "startMs": 72980,
    "endMs": 74840,
    "text": "2."
  },
  {
    "id": "c17",
    "startMs": 75400,
    "endMs": 76260,
    "text": "Listen and match."
  },
  {
    "id": "c18",
    "startMs": 85860,
    "endMs": 86660,
    "text": "Hi,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c19",
    "startMs": 87940,
    "endMs": 90740,
    "text": "Mr. Zhong."
  },
  {
    "id": "c20",
    "startMs": 92960,
    "endMs": 94280,
    "text": "I joined the art club."
  },
  {
    "id": "c21",
    "startMs": 94860,
    "endMs": 96320,
    "text": "We have a lot of fun there,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c22",
    "startMs": 96800,
    "endMs": 98640,
    "text": "drawing and painting every day."
  },
  {
    "id": "c23",
    "startMs": 100260,
    "endMs": 104940,
    "text": "2. Are you going to join a club next time James?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c24",
    "startMs": 105760,
    "endMs": 105920,
    "text": "Sure."
  },
  {
    "id": "c25",
    "startMs": 106600,
    "endMs": 107660,
    "text": "I'll join the photo club."
  },
  {
    "id": "c26",
    "startMs": 108380,
    "endMs": 110400,
    "text": "I want to keep the sweet moments in life."
  },
  {
    "id": "c27",
    "startMs": 113730,
    "endMs": 115580,
    "text": "3. Hi Shaupu."
  },
  {
    "id": "c28",
    "startMs": 116280,
    "endMs": 117080,
    "text": "What are you doing?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c29",
    "startMs": 117720,
    "endMs": 118320,
    "text": "Hi Shen Shen."
  },
  {
    "id": "c30",
    "startMs": 118880,
    "endMs": 119720,
    "text": "I'm flying a kite."
  },
  {
    "id": "c31",
    "startMs": 120220,
    "endMs": 120280,
    "text": "See?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c32",
    "startMs": 121220,
    "endMs": 122960,
    "text": "My kite is flying high in the sky."
  },
  {
    "id": "c33",
    "startMs": 123800,
    "endMs": 124940,
    "text": "I'm in the kite flying club."
  },
  {
    "id": "c34",
    "startMs": 127300,
    "endMs": 131240,
    "text": "4. Why are you so busy these days, Xiao Zhan?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c35",
    "startMs": 131740,
    "endMs": 133240,
    "text": "Because it's hard to prepare the"
  },
  {
    "id": "c36",
    "startMs": 133240,
    "endMs": 135040,
    "text": "Dragon Dance for the coming festival."
  },
  {
    "id": "c37",
    "startMs": 136300,
    "endMs": 137260,
    "text": "As the members of"
  },
  {
    "id": "c38",
    "startMs": 137260,
    "endMs": 138320,
    "text": "the Dragon Dance Club,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c39",
    "startMs": 138920,
    "endMs": 141400,
    "text": "we practice every afternoon after class."
  },
  {
    "id": "c40",
    "startMs": 144860,
    "endMs": 146660,
    "text": "3. Listen and judge"
  },
  {
    "id": "c41",
    "startMs": 156450,
    "endMs": 167080,
    "text": "I think it's on the 25th of September."
  },
  {
    "id": "c42",
    "startMs": 167800,
    "endMs": 169300,
    "text": "No, that's not right."
  },
  {
    "id": "c43",
    "startMs": 170100,
    "endMs": 171910,
    "text": "It's on the 26th of September."
  },
  {
    "id": "c44",
    "startMs": 172880,
    "endMs": 173600,
    "text": "Oh, I see."
  },
  {
    "id": "c45",
    "startMs": 174160,
    "endMs": 174460,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "id": "c46",
    "startMs": 176700,
    "endMs": 178640,
    "text": "Two. James,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c47",
    "startMs": 179440,
    "endMs": 183120,
    "text": "what does Mr. Jong usually say about Chang-chuan in class?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c48",
    "startMs": 184020,
    "endMs": 185040,
    "text": "Is it called the"
  },
  {
    "id": "c49",
    "startMs": 185340,
    "endMs": 186740,
    "text": "father of many Kung-fu styles?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c50",
    "startMs": 187680,
    "endMs": 189180,
    "text": "No, he never says that."
  },
  {
    "id": "c51",
    "startMs": 189780,
    "endMs": 191960,
    "text": "He always says Chang-chuan is the"
  },
  {
    "id": "c52",
    "startMs": 191960,
    "endMs": 194520,
    "text": "mother of many Kung-fu styles because"
  },
  {
    "id": "c53",
    "startMs": 194840,
    "endMs": 196500,
    "text": "lots of Kung-fu comes from it."
  },
  {
    "id": "c54",
    "startMs": 196920,
    "endMs": 197640,
    "text": "Oh, right."
  },
  {
    "id": "c55",
    "startMs": 199500,
    "endMs": 201900,
    "text": "3. Look,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c56",
    "startMs": 202760,
    "endMs": 204960,
    "text": "Mr. John is showing us how to do Changshuan."
  },
  {
    "id": "c57",
    "startMs": 205820,
    "endMs": 208020,
    "text": "He says he moves as fast as a plane."
  },
  {
    "id": "c58",
    "startMs": 208520,
    "endMs": 211740,
    "text": "No. He says I move as fast as the wind."
  },
  {
    "id": "c59",
    "startMs": 212720,
    "endMs": 214040,
    "text": "A plane is fast."
  },
  {
    "id": "c60",
    "startMs": 215060,
    "endMs": 216070,
    "text": "But he never says that."
  },
  {
    "id": "c61",
    "startMs": 216880,
    "endMs": 217480,
    "text": "Oh, you're right."
  },
  {
    "id": "c62",
    "startMs": 219840,
    "endMs": 224660,
    "text": "4. Why do the students in the Dragon Dance Club train so hard?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c63",
    "startMs": 225660,
    "endMs": 226560,
    "text": "Is it because Ming Ming"
  },
  {
    "id": "c64",
    "startMs": 226740,
    "endMs": 228940,
    "text": "the head of the dragon runs too slowly?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c65",
    "startMs": 230200,
    "endMs": 230420,
    "text": "No,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c66",
    "startMs": 231060,
    "endMs": 231940,
    "text": "that's not the reason."
  },
  {
    "id": "c67",
    "startMs": 232800,
    "endMs": 234440,
    "text": "Min Min always runs too fast,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c68",
    "startMs": 235260,
    "endMs": 237440,
    "text": "so the other students can't keep up with him."
  },
  {
    "id": "c69",
    "startMs": 238260,
    "endMs": 239540,
    "text": "They don't work as a team,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c70",
    "startMs": 240300,
    "endMs": 241320,
    "text": "so they need more training."
  },
  {
    "id": "c71",
    "startMs": 243060,
    "endMs": 244240,
    "text": "5."
  },
  {
    "id": "c72",
    "startMs": 245120,
    "endMs": 245860,
    "text": "Hi, Yow-Yow."
  },
  {
    "id": "c73",
    "startMs": 246420,
    "endMs": 248600,
    "text": "When we play games at the school garden party,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c74",
    "startMs": 249180,
    "endMs": 251120,
    "text": "do we get a toy car after each game?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c75",
    "startMs": 251540,
    "endMs": 251820,
    "text": "No,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c76",
    "startMs": 252340,
    "endMs": 253320,
    "text": "the rule is clear."
  },
  {
    "id": "c77",
    "startMs": 254220,
    "endMs": 257500,
    "text": "get a stamp on our cards after playing each game."
  },
  {
    "id": "c78",
    "startMs": 258440,
    "endMs": 259780,
    "text": "When we collect enough stamps,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c79",
    "startMs": 260120,
    "endMs": 261770,
    "text": "we can exchange them for a prize."
  },
  {
    "id": "c80",
    "startMs": 262580,
    "endMs": 262900,
    "text": "Got it."
  },
  {
    "id": "c81",
    "startMs": 263480,
    "endMs": 264340,
    "text": "Let's bring our cards."
  },
  {
    "id": "c82",
    "startMs": 267540,
    "endMs": 267700,
    "text": "4."
  },
  {
    "id": "c83",
    "startMs": 268560,
    "endMs": 269380,
    "text": "Listen and complete."
  },
  {
    "id": "c84",
    "startMs": 270260,
    "endMs": 270760,
    "text": "Yo Iguisha,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c85",
    "startMs": 271500,
    "endMs": 274160,
    "text": "kandotung shi etsai jeongdong wan yi kai sing yoi si,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c86",
    "startMs": 274680,
    "endMs": 275820,
    "text": "ting yi ting buchu"
  },
  {
    "id": "c87",
    "startMs": 275820,
    "endMs": 276380,
    "text": "an chuizi."
  },
  {
    "id": "c88",
    "startMs": 278540,
    "endMs": 281460,
    "text": "Pitchpot is a cool traditional Chinese game."
  },
  {
    "id": "c89",
    "startMs": 282880,
    "endMs": 284360,
    "text": "easy and fun to play."
  },
  {
    "id": "c90",
    "startMs": 285520,
    "endMs": 286800,
    "text": "You only need two things."
  },
  {
    "id": "c91",
    "startMs": 287800,
    "endMs": 290140,
    "text": "A big pot and some thin arrows."
  },
  {
    "id": "c92",
    "startMs": 291680,
    "endMs": 293500,
    "text": "First, find a safe place."
  },
  {
    "id": "c93",
    "startMs": 294600,
    "endMs": 297900,
    "text": "Players stand 3 to 4 meters away from the pot."
  },
  {
    "id": "c94",
    "startMs": 298960,
    "endMs": 299460,
    "text": "Don't stand"
  },
  {
    "id": "c95",
    "startMs": 299460,
    "endMs": 300200,
    "text": "too close."
  },
  {
    "id": "c96",
    "startMs": 301540,
    "endMs": 303060,
    "text": "Take turns to throw the arrows."
  },
  {
    "id": "c97",
    "startMs": 304120,
    "endMs": 306780,
    "text": "Try your best to get the arrows into the pot."
  },
  {
    "id": "c98",
    "startMs": 308200,
    "endMs": 309920,
    "text": "Every time your arrow goes in,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c99",
    "startMs": 310380,
    "endMs": 311560,
    "text": "you get one point."
  },
  {
    "id": "c100",
    "startMs": 312660,
    "endMs": 314540,
    "text": "Play for five or ten rounds."
  },
  {
    "id": "c101",
    "startMs": 315640,
    "endMs": 317960,
    "text": "After all rounds, count your points."
  },
  {
    "id": "c102",
    "startMs": 318880,
    "endMs": 320660,
    "text": "The player with the most points wins."
  },
  {
    "id": "c103",
    "startMs": 322360,
    "endMs": 322800,
    "text": "Long ago,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c104",
    "startMs": 323060,
    "endMs": 325540,
    "text": "Chinese people loved playing Pitch Part 2."
  },
  {
    "id": "c105",
    "startMs": 326480,
    "endMs": 328560,
    "text": "Now you can play it with your friends."
  },
  {
    "id": "c106",
    "startMs": 331800,
    "endMs": 334740,
    "text": "Pitch Part is a cool traditional Chinese game."
  },
  {
    "id": "c107",
    "startMs": 335820,
    "endMs": 337580,
    "text": "It's easy and fun to play."
  },
  {
    "id": "c108",
